  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Wool Tweaks 对羊毛、床和地毯的染色机制进行了多项更改。在合成表中，你可以将任何颜色的物品染成任意颜色，而不仅仅是白色变体。此外，手持染料右键点击已放置的方块即可改变其颜色。模组还包含一个配方，可将任意颜色的羊毛转化为 4 根线。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"Included in The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"Included in Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意羊毛方块以进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意床方块以进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意地毯方块以进行转换：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>将任意颜色的羊毛合成为 4 根线：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在合成表中染色任意羊毛：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在合成表中染色任意床：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在合成表中染色任意地毯：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源保持在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中，您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他反馈，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
